{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19872","headline":"择友 · 孟郊","name":"择友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兽中有人性，形异遭人隔。\n人中有兽心，几人能真识。\n古人形似兽，皆有大圣德。\n今人表似人，兽心安可测。\n虽笑未必和，虽哭未必戚。\n面结口头交，肚里生荆棘。\n好人常直道，不顺世间逆。\n恶人巧谄多，非义苟且得。\n若是傚真人，坚心如铁石。\n不谄亦不欺，不奢复不溺。\n面无恡色容，心无诈忧惕。\n君子大道人，朝夕恒的的。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19872.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19872","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}